[1.152934, "o", "========================================\r\n  typesafe-llm-router — morning demo\r\n========================================\r\n\r\n=== INPUT ===\r\ntask_class: ShortClassify\r\ncurrent_model: composer-2.5\r\nallowlist: [\"composer-2.5\", \"composer-2.5-fast\", \"grok-4.6\", \"grok-4.6-fast\", \"grok-4.5\", \"grok-4.5-fast\"]\r\nsession:\r\n  [0] system: You label support tickets with exactly one of: billing | bug | feature | other. Reply with one label only. Shared classifier preamble used on every ticket (~400 tokens of policy examples omitted here).\r\n  [1] user: I was charged twice for my annual plan and the portal still shows active. Please fix.\r\n\r\n=== PROCESS ===\r\n  → ModelSource.list_models (stub) → Choice allowlist + $/MTok\r\n  → System One Choice route (StubTypesafeClient / jev-latest shape)\r\n  → ModelSource = stub (chosen_model id == complete model_id)\r\n  → ModelSource.complete (stub)\r\n"]
[1.153565, "o", "  → chosen_model = composer-2.5 (T-small)\r\n  → ModelSource.complete → model_output ready\r\n  → score: pending/enqueued (job score_1789643156721005675) — async worker later; NOT on hot path\r\n  → primary_reason = continue_current\r\n\r\n=== OUTPUT ===\r\nselected_model: composer-2.5 [T-small]\r\nprimary_reason: continue_current\r\nmodel_output:\r\nbilling\r\n\r\n=== OUTCOME META ===\r\nscores_status: Pending\r\n(drain later: cargo run -- drain-score-queue --stub)\r\n\r\n"]
